  "reference_solution": "[정답] ②\n\n[해설]\n$\\sin \\left( - \\theta \\right) = - \\sin \\theta = \\frac{1}{3}$에서    $\\sin \\theta = - \\frac{1}{3}$\n$\\frac{2}{3} \\pi < \\theta < 2 \\pi$이므로\n$\\cos \\theta$$= \\sqrt{1 - \\sin^{2} \\theta}$$= \\sqrt{1 - \\left( - \\frac{1}{3} \\right)^{2}}$$= \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3}$\n$\\therefore$ $\\tan \\theta = \\frac{\\sin \\theta}{\\cos \\theta} = - \\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{2}} = - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$\n",
  "problem_text": "$\\frac{3}{2} \\pi < \\theta < 2 \\pi$인 $\\theta$에 대하여 $\\sin \\left( - \\theta \\right) = \\frac{1}{3}$일 때, $\\tan \\theta$의 값은?\n① $- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\t② $- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$\t③ $- \\frac{1}{4}$\n④ $\\frac{1}{4}$\t\t⑤ $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$\n",
